From: RTSP-on-GE11
Subject: [PATCH] include: Register the private media presentation-origin header.

Patch 0071 introduced this header without listing it in the global source
inventory. Fresh Wine makedep therefore rejects its consumers even though
the compiler can find the file with an already-generated Makefile.

This only registers the existing header; no C or playback behavior changes.

--- a/include/Makefile.in
+++ b/include/Makefile.in
@@ -981,6 +981,7 @@ SOURCES = \
 	wine/itss.idl \
 	wine/list.h \
 	wine/mfinternal.idl \
+	wine/mforigin.h \
 	wine/mmsystem16.h \
 	wine/mscvpdb.h \
 	wine/mssign.h \
